      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ===== SIDEBAR QUOTE SECTION ===== */}
    <section class="sketch-section" id="quote">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="sketch-quote-layout">
          <div class="sketch-quote-content">
            <h2 class="sketch-section__title">Have an Idea on Paper?</h2>
            <p class="sketch-quote-desc">Don't worry if your sketch isn't perfect. Send us what you've drawn and tell us what you're trying to create. We'll review your concept and explain how we can turn it into professional digital artwork.</p>
            <div class="service-detail-actions">
